        <mxCell id="gizu-systems-02-62" parent="1" vertex="1" value="Buy splits each source operation’s private input 30/30/40. Sell returns each holding leg’s verified proceeds to its corresponding fresh wallet; it does not apply that split again.&#10;The public funding transfer, token trades and final payouts remain visible on-chain. Confidential credit is the private middle; providers and timing can still reveal links." style="text;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontStyle=0;fontColor=#23354B;">
